      "writtenOn": "2022-06-21T21:24:00Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Some of the shared CONFIG_ options should get moved to the Kconfig.defconfig file, which is shared by both the it81202bx and it81301bx variants.\n\nExample from upstream is here:\nhttps://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/blob/main/boards/arm/mimxrt1064_evk/Kconfig.defconfig\n\nAt a minimum, all the ITE drivers should get setup the Kconfig.defconfig file\n\n```\nif I2C\nconfig I2C_ITE_IT8XXX2\n\tdefault y\nendif\n\nif ADC\nconfig ADC_ITE_IT8XXX2\n\tdefault y\nconfig PLATFORM_EC_ADC\n\tdefault y\nconfig PLATFORM_EC_ADC_RESOLUTION\n\tdefault 10\nendif\n```\n\nBecause the Kconfig.defconfig supports the `source/rsource` commands, we could also move the EC common defaults (such as the CONSOLE/SHELL settings) into a shared file that each board/Kconfig.defconfig includes via `source/rsource`.  The EC common defaults is outside the scope of this change.",
      "parentUuid": "ff6246f4_7be8fd6e",
      "revId": "e2b55489f567e8405050d7cfa1fad1d7bee94892",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    }
